### Test Server (should return 200)
GET http://localhost:3000

### ===== AUTHENTICATION =====

### Register User
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test User",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Login User (COPY token from response body)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### ===== PASTE TOKEN BELOW =====
### After you run "Login User" above, copy the token value and paste it below
### Example: @token = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...

@token =eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1c2VySWQiOiI2OWNmMTRmNTlhNWQyNWMzNmYwZDBjMWMiLCJlbWFpbCI6InRlc3RAZXhhbXBsZS5jb20iLCJpYXQiOjE3NzUyNTg0NzQsImV4cCI6MTc3NTI2MjA3NH0.zgu7GTuaSNtmeObCHtu0SlEhTzOWiFGqvW832TxYi1o

### ===== NOTE CRUD TESTS =====

### Create Note
POST http://localhost:3000/api/notes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "My First Note",
  "content": "<h1>Hello World</h1>"
}

### Get All Notes
GET http://localhost:3000/api/notes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Single Note
GET http://localhost:3000/api/notes/69cf159a9a5d25c36f0d0c1f
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update Note
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/notes/69cf159a9a5d25c36f0d0c1f
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Updated Title",
  "content": "<p>Updated</p>"
}

### Delete Note
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/notes/REPLACE_WITH_NOTE_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ===== FOLDER CRUD TESTS =====

### Create Folder
POST http://localhost:3000/api/folders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Work Notes"
}

### Get All Folders
GET http://localhost:3000/api/folders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Rename Folder (replace REPLACE_WITH_FOLDER_ID with _id from create response)
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/folders/REPLACE_WITH_FOLDER_ID
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Personal Notes"
}

### Delete Folder
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/folders/REPLACE_WITH_FOLDER_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
